recommend check-in (Claude) -- two things want a word rather than a lap. The operator card closed at ONE byte under its ceiling with eight ships writing it, so the next ship overflows before it types; and the anointed spine double-books %530, which reds reds_spine_derive fleet-wide and cannot be repaired without moving a published number. The lane's own next lap is ready and mechanical whenever those clear: bron-resins/ resins record no marks at all, which is this same question one room over, and mark_verdict is where the registry the foundation names would attach
